        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 802HE, Traditional Hawthorne Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Kwikset made Hawthorne Handleset is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this handleset is that the decorative grip will never go out of style; a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years. The simple handle features square mounts. This handleset is made out of solid brass construction. The dummy cylinder 802HE Door Entry Set neither latches nor locks and is usually used as a pull on inactive doors. It is backed by a Lifetime finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/hawthorne-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800he\"><b>Hawthorne Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Hawthorne Dummy Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li> Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 802HE Hawthorne Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 17-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 13-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Deadbolt to Center of Top Plate: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt:  8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hawthorne Dummy Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 802HE",
                "description": "Kwikset 802HE Hawthorne Dummy Cylinder Handleset - This Kwikset made Hawthorne Handleset is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this handleset is that the decorative grip will never go out of style; a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years. The simple handle features square mounts. This handleset is made out of solid brass construction. The dummy cylinder 802HE Door Entry Set neither latches nor locks and is usually used as a pull on inactive doors. It is backed by a Lifetime finish warranty.\r\n",
